{number: 52}
{title: Wonderful Words Of Life}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] Sing them over again to me, wonderful words of [G7] life;
Let me more of their beauty see, wonderful words of [C] life;
Words of [F] life and [C] beauty, teach me [F] faith and [C] duty.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G7] Beautiful words, [C] wonderful words,
[G7] Wonderful words of [C] life;
[G7] Beautiful words, [C] wonderful words,
[G7] Wonderful words of [C] life.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C] Christ, the blessed One, gives to all, wonderful words of [G7] life;
Sinner, list to the loving call, wonderful words of [C] life.
All so [F] freely [C] given, wooing [F] us to [C] heaven.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C] Sweetly echo the gospel call, wonderful words of [G7] life,
Offer pardon and peace to all, wonderful words of [C] life.
Jesus, [F] only [C] Saviour, sancti-[F] fy for [C] ever.
{end_of_verse}
